<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange ended higher in active trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 92.71 to 6679.87.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 4.13 to 401.75.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.41.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1401 to 1038.</p>
<p>Volume was 498,815,150 compared with 506,853,680 on Tuesday.</p>
